{"seq":2,"slug":"decorator-interceptor","title":"装饰器与拦截器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/decorator-interceptor","wordCount":1272,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"装饰器与拦截器\">装饰器与拦截器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>装饰器和拦截器是利用 DI 容器实现开放-封闭原则的两种互补技术。装饰器通过实现同一接口并包装原始服务来叠加新行为（如缓存、日志），具有编译期类型安全但需为每个接口编写专门类；拦截器通过动态代理在方法调用前后插入横切逻辑（如性能监控、事务管理），一次编写可应用于多个接口但依赖反射。两者的共同目标是在不修改原始服务代码的前提下扩展系统行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"横切关注点的挑战\">横切关注点的挑战</h2><p>日志记录、性能监控、缓存、事务管理、重试策略——这些功能横跨多个服务，与核心业务逻辑正交。如果在每个服务中重复实现这些关注点，代码会充满样板噪音，且修改一个横切策略（如把日志格式从 text 改为 JSON）需要改动所有服务。</p>\n<p>DI 容器提供了两种优雅的解决方案：<strong>装饰器模式</strong>和<strong>拦截器模式</strong>。两者都遵循开放-封闭原则——对扩展开放（可以叠加新行为），对修改封闭（不改动原始服务代码）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>装饰器 (Decorator)</th>\n<th>拦截器 (Interceptor)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>包装整个服务接口</td>\n<td>拦截特定方法调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>编译期类型检查</td>\n<td>通常基于反射/动态代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>需为每个接口写装饰器类</td>\n<td>一个拦截器可应用于多个接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>零额外开销（直接函数调用）</td>\n<td>有反射/代理开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型实现</td>\n<td>Scrutor (.NET) / 手动包装</td>\n<td>Castle DynamicProxy / Spring AOP</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"装饰器模式与-di\">装饰器模式与 DI</h2><p>装饰器通过实现同一接口并持有原始服务的引用来叠加行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 原始服务&#10;public class SqlOrderRepository : IOrderRepository&#10;{&#10;    public async Task&lt;Order&gt; GetById(OrderId id)&#10;    {&#10;        // 直接查数据库&#10;        return await _dbContext.Orders.FindAsync(id);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 缓存装饰器——包装原始服务，添加缓存层&#10;public class CachingOrderRepository : IOrderRepository&#10;{&#10;    private readonly IOrderRepository _inner;&#10;    private readonly ICache _cache;&#10;&#10;    public CachingOrderRepository(IOrderRepository inner, ICache cache)&#10;    {&#10;        _inner = inner;&#10;        _cache = cache;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public async Task&lt;Order&gt; GetById(OrderId id)&#10;    {&#10;        var cached = await _cache.Get&lt;Order&gt;($&quot;order:{id}&quot;);&#10;        if (cached != null) return cached;&#10;&#10;        var order = await _inner.GetById(id); // 委托给原始实现&#10;        await _cache.Set($&quot;order:{id}&quot;, order, TimeSpan.FromMinutes(5));&#10;        return order;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class SqlOrderRepository : IOrderRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public async Task&#x3C;Order> GetById(OrderId id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 直接查数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return await _dbContext.Orders.FindAsync(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 缓存装饰器——包装原始服务，添加缓存层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class CachingOrderRepository : IOrderRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly IOrderRepository _inner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly ICache _cache;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public CachingOrderRepository(IOrderRepository inner, ICache cache)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _inner = inner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _cache = cache;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public async Task&#x3C;Order> GetById(OrderId id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var cached = await _cache.Get&#x3C;Order>($\"order:{id}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (cached != null) return cached;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var order = await _inner.GetById(id); // 委托给原始实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        await _cache.Set($\"order:{id}\", order, TimeSpan.FromMinutes(5));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return order;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Composition Root 中注册装饰器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// .NET + Scrutor 库&#10;builder.Services.AddScoped&lt;IOrderRepository, SqlOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;builder.Services.Decorate&lt;IOrderRepository, CachingOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;builder.Services.Decorate&lt;IOrderRepository, LoggingOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;// 解析顺序：Logging → Caching → SQL（洋葱模型）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// .NET + Scrutor 库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.AddScoped&#x3C;IOrderRepository, SqlOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.Decorate&#x3C;IOrderRepository, CachingOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>builder.Services.Decorate&#x3C;IOrderRepository, LoggingOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 解析顺序：Logging → Caching → SQL（洋葱模型）</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Consumer[OrderService] --&gt; Logging[LoggingOrderRepo]&#10;    Logging --&gt; Caching[CachingOrderRepo]&#10;    Caching --&gt; SQL[SqlOrderRepo]&#10;    SQL --&gt; DB[(Database)]&#10;&#10;    Logging -.- L1[记录调用日志]&#10;    Caching -.- C1[检查/更新缓存]&#10;    SQL -.- S1[执行 SQL 查询]\">graph LR\n    Consumer[OrderService] --&gt; Logging[LoggingOrderRepo]\n    Logging --&gt; Caching[CachingOrderRepo]\n    Caching --&gt; SQL[SqlOrderRepo]\n    SQL --&gt; DB[(Database)]\n\n    Logging -.- L1[记录调用日志]\n    Caching -.- C1[检查/更新缓存]\n    SQL -.- S1[执行 SQL 查询]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"装饰器链的洋葱模型\">装饰器链的洋葱模型</h2><p>多个装饰器叠加形成洋葱结构——请求从外向内穿过每一层，响应从内向外返回：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as Consumer&#10;    participant Log as LoggingDecorator&#10;    participant Cache as CachingDecorator&#10;    participant Retry as RetryDecorator&#10;    participant Real as RealService&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;Log: GetById(id)&#10;    Note over Log: 记录请求开始&#10;    Log-&gt;&gt;Cache: GetById(id)&#10;    Note over Cache: 缓存未命中&#10;    Cache-&gt;&gt;Retry: GetById(id)&#10;    Note over Retry: 第一次尝试&#10;    Retry-&gt;&gt;Real: GetById(id)&#10;    Real--&gt;&gt;Retry: 返回结果&#10;    Retry--&gt;&gt;Cache: 返回结果&#10;    Note over Cache: 写入缓存&#10;    Cache--&gt;&gt;Log: 返回结果&#10;    Note over Log: 记录耗时&#10;    Log--&gt;&gt;C: 返回最终结果\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as Consumer\n    participant Log as LoggingDecorator\n    participant Cache as CachingDecorator\n    participant Retry as RetryDecorator\n    participant Real as RealService\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;Log: GetById(id)\n    Note over Log: 记录请求开始\n    Log-&gt;&gt;Cache: GetById(id)\n    Note over Cache: 缓存未命中\n    Cache-&gt;&gt;Retry: GetById(id)\n    Note over Retry: 第一次尝试\n    Retry-&gt;&gt;Real: GetById(id)\n    Real--&gt;&gt;Retry: 返回结果\n    Retry--&gt;&gt;Cache: 返回结果\n    Note over Cache: 写入缓存\n    Cache--&gt;&gt;Log: 返回结果\n    Note over Log: 记录耗时\n    Log--&gt;&gt;C: 返回最终结果</pre><p><strong>装饰器顺序很重要</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>日志应在最外层——记录包含缓存命中/未命中的完整路径</li>\n<li>缓存在日志之后——缓存命中时跳过后续所有层</li>\n<li>重试在最内层——只重试实际的外部调用，不重试缓存操作</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"拦截器模式\">拦截器模式</h2><p>拦截器通过动态代理在方法调用前后插入逻辑，无需为每个接口编写专门的装饰器类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Spring AOP 拦截器&#10;@Aspect&#10;@Component&#10;public class PerformanceInterceptor {&#10;&#10;    @Around(&quot;execution(* com.app.service.*.*(..))&quot;)&#10;    public Object measurePerformance(ProceedingJoinPoint joinPoint) throws Throwable {&#10;        long start = System.nanoTime();&#10;        try {&#10;            Object result = joinPoint.proceed(); // 调用原始方法&#10;            return result;&#10;        } finally {&#10;            long elapsed = System.nanoTime() - start;&#10;            log.info(&quot;{}.{} took {}ms&quot;,&#10;                joinPoint.getTarget().getClass().getSimpleName(),&#10;                joinPoint.getSignature().getName(),&#10;                elapsed / 1_000_000);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Spring AOP 拦截器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Aspect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceInterceptor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Around</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"execution(* com.app.service.*.*(..))\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Object </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measurePerformance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ProceedingJoinPoint </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">joinPoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Throwable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> System.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nanoTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            Object result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> joinPoint.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">proceed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调用原始方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">finally</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> System.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nanoTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{}.{} took {}ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                joinPoint.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTarget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getClass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getSimpleName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                joinPoint.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getSignature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// NestJS 拦截器&#10;@Injectable()&#10;export class LoggingInterceptor implements NestInterceptor {&#10;  intercept(context: ExecutionContext, next: CallHandler): Observable&lt;any&gt; {&#10;    const methodName = context.getHandler().name;&#10;    const start = Date.now();&#10;&#10;    return next.handle().pipe(&#10;      tap(() =&gt; {&#10;        console.log(`${methodName} took ${Date.now() - start}ms`);&#10;      }),&#10;    );&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 全局应用&#10;app.useGlobalInterceptors(new LoggingInterceptor());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// NestJS 拦截器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Injectable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoggingInterceptor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> implements</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> NestInterceptor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  intercept</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExecutionContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CallHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Observable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> methodName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      tap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">methodName</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">} took ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 全局应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">useGlobalInterceptors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoggingInterceptor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"装饰器-vs-拦截器-选择指南\">装饰器 vs 拦截器：选择指南</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>为特定接口添加缓存层</td>\n<td>装饰器</td>\n<td>类型安全，缓存逻辑与接口契约紧密相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>所有服务添加性能监控</td>\n<td>拦截器</td>\n<td>通用逻辑，一次编写多处生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>为 Repository 添加重试</td>\n<td>装饰器</td>\n<td>重试策略与具体操作语义相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方法调用审计日志</td>\n<td>拦截器</td>\n<td>纯横切，与业务逻辑完全无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事务管理</td>\n<td>拦截器</td>\n<td><code>@Transactional</code> 就是拦截器的应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入验证</td>\n<td>装饰器或管道</td>\n<td>验证规则与接口参数强相关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>经验法则</strong>：如果横切逻辑需要了解接口的语义（如&quot;这个方法的返回值适合缓存&quot;），用装饰器；如果横切逻辑完全通用（如&quot;记录所有方法的调用耗时&quot;），用拦截器。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型装饰器-消除重复\">泛型装饰器：消除重复</h2><p>对于具有统一模式的接口族，泛型装饰器能一次编写、应用于所有实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 泛型命令处理器接口&#10;public interface ICommandHandler&lt;TCommand&gt;&#10;{&#10;    Task Handle(TCommand command);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 泛型日志装饰器——适用于所有 ICommandHandler&lt;T&gt;&#10;public class LoggingCommandHandler&lt;TCommand&gt; : ICommandHandler&lt;TCommand&gt;&#10;{&#10;    private readonly ICommandHandler&lt;TCommand&gt; _inner;&#10;    private readonly ILogger _logger;&#10;&#10;    public LoggingCommandHandler(ICommandHandler&lt;TCommand&gt; inner, ILogger logger)&#10;    {&#10;        _inner = inner;&#10;        _logger = logger;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public async Task Handle(TCommand command)&#10;    {&#10;        _logger.Info($&quot;Handling {typeof(TCommand).Name}&quot;);&#10;        await _inner.Handle(command);&#10;        _logger.Info($&quot;Handled {typeof(TCommand).Name}&quot;);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 注册：所有 ICommandHandler&lt;T&gt; 自动被 Logging 装饰&#10;services.AddScoped(typeof(ICommandHandler&lt;&gt;), typeof(LoggingCommandHandler&lt;&gt;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 泛型命令处理器接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public interface ICommandHandler&#x3C;TCommand></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Task Handle(TCommand command);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 泛型日志装饰器——适用于所有 ICommandHandler&#x3C;T></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class LoggingCommandHandler&#x3C;TCommand> : ICommandHandler&#x3C;TCommand></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly ICommandHandler&#x3C;TCommand> _inner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly ILogger _logger;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public LoggingCommandHandler(ICommandHandler&#x3C;TCommand> inner, ILogger logger)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _inner = inner;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _logger = logger;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public async Task Handle(TCommand command)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _logger.Info($\"Handling {typeof(TCommand).Name}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        await _inner.Handle(command);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _logger.Info($\"Handled {typeof(TCommand).Name}\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 注册：所有 ICommandHandler&#x3C;T> 自动被 Logging 装饰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped(typeof(ICommandHandler&#x3C;>), typeof(LoggingCommandHandler&#x3C;>));</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;泛型装饰器管道&quot;&#10;        Any[任意 Command] --&gt; Log[LoggingHandler T]&#10;        Log --&gt; Validate[ValidationHandler T]&#10;        Validate --&gt; Real[具体 CommandHandler]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    CreateOrder[CreateOrderCommand] --&gt; Log&#10;    CancelOrder[CancelOrderCommand] --&gt; Log&#10;    RefundOrder[RefundOrderCommand] --&gt; Log\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"泛型装饰器管道\"\n        Any[任意 Command] --&gt; Log[LoggingHandler T]\n        Log --&gt; Validate[ValidationHandler T]\n        Validate --&gt; Real[具体 CommandHandler]\n    end\n\n    CreateOrder[CreateOrderCommand] --&gt; Log\n    CancelOrder[CancelOrderCommand] --&gt; Log\n    RefundOrder[RefundOrderCommand] --&gt; Log</pre><p>这种模式在 CQRS 架构中极为常见——所有 Command/Query Handler 共享同一套横切管道（日志、验证、事务、性能追踪），新增 Handler 自动获得所有横切能力。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"注意事项与陷阱\">注意事项与陷阱</h2><p><strong>装饰器层数控制</strong>：超过 3-4 层装饰器会让调用栈难以调试。如果需要多个横切关注点，考虑将它们合并为一个&quot;管道中间件&quot;而非独立装饰器。</p>\n<p><strong>避免有状态装饰器</strong>：装饰器应该是无状态的（或状态与被装饰服务的生命周期一致）。有状态的装饰器容易引入 Captive Dependency 问题。</p>\n<p><strong>接口隔离</strong>：如果一个接口有 20 个方法，装饰器需要为所有 20 个方法提供实现（即使大多数只是 passthrough）。这是接口太胖的信号——应用接口隔离原则拆分接口。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>装饰器和拦截器是 DI 在&quot;非侵入式扩展&quot;维度上的核心价值体现。装饰器适合与接口语义强相关的横切逻辑（缓存、重试），拦截器适合完全通用的横切逻辑（日志、性能追踪）。泛型装饰器在 CQRS 管道中尤为强大——新 Handler 自动获得全套横切能力。实践中需控制装饰层数（不超过 3-4 层）、保持装饰器无状态、并以接口隔离原则约束接口大小以避免 passthrough 方法过多。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>相关文档：<a href=\"composition-root\">Composition Root</a> 展示装饰器如何在 Composition Root 中统一注册。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"装饰器与拦截器","id":"装饰器与拦截器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"横切关注点的挑战","id":"横切关注点的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"装饰器模式与 DI","id":"装饰器模式与-di"},{"level":2,"text":"装饰器链的洋葱模型","id":"装饰器链的洋葱模型"},{"level":2,"text":"拦截器模式","id":"拦截器模式"},{"level":2,"text":"装饰器 vs 拦截器：选择指南","id":"装饰器-vs-拦截器-选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型装饰器：消除重复","id":"泛型装饰器-消除重复"},{"level":2,"text":"注意事项与陷阱","id":"注意事项与陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Composition Root 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/composition-root"},"next":{"title":"模块边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/advanced/module-boundary"}}